# `Podfile.lock` is deliberately not listed above, and `Pods/` is. The lock is a
# few readable lines pinning the pod versions this example was last known to
# build against — the same reason `example/pubspec.lock` is committed while the
# published package's own is not. `Pods/` is what `pod install` downloads from
# that pin: tens of megabytes, regenerated on demand, and unreviewable. Track
# the pin, not the download.
